  "Scenes.Corruptedcoven.DemonLord2.ClimbOverEachOther": "[pg]They climb over each other and begin a brawl, most of them too addled with lust to put much resistance at all. You merely watch and laugh as, one by one, your slaves are knocked out. At the end, only one remains."
  "Scenes.Corruptedcoven.DemonLord2.CongratulateOnFighting": "[pg]You congratulate her on her fighting prowess, and say that it's time that the greatest warrior-sorceress in all the land receive a reward for her courage. You point your nubby prick towards her, your cumslit widening, preparing to shoot its pent-up load. "
  "Scenes.Corruptedcoven.DemonLord2.CrazedScreamsTurnInto": "[pg]Her crazed screams soon turn into a smooth, sensual sigh. Her skin turns a pale blue, her sclera pitch black, and elegant horns sprout from her forehead. You remove your cock from inside her now vice-tight cunt, the length of your shaft covered in liquid lethicite, Circe's soul."
