  "Scenes.Corruptedcoven.DemonLord2.FightLastsSeveralMinutes": "The fight lasts several minutes, and by the end of it, your entire throne room is charred by whitefire, several of the columns and arches shattered. You've sustained your fair share of injuries, and members of your guard have perished merely by collateral damage."
